      "name": "trade approach",
      "description": "Defines a trading approach, or rewrites its description, in the trading journal (approaches/<name>.md; its trades and lessons stay). Run with {\"name\": \"breakout_retest\", \"title\": \"Breakout Retest\", \"description\": \"what it reads and when it says to act, with what the lessons taught\"}. Reuse names, so each approach's record builds up.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "go",
